// Package hphinativescalaralgebra implements Gate 407:
// H_phi-Native Scalar Selector Algebra / Pair-Degeneracy Closure Sieve.
//
// Gate 406 classified the contact quartic q4 as an internal contact-sector
// invariant and closed the q4 -> H_phi forcing route under the current functor
// inventory. Gate 407 therefore works entirely inside the scalar carrier H_phi.
// It audits the algebra generated by native H_phi endomorphisms: quaternionic
// weak-module actions, the pair-degenerate scalar response, and the canonical
// one-form/Yukawa edge quotient. The key distinction is capacity versus a
// selected theorem. Full left/right quaternionic actions plus the scalar pair
// split generate a large enough algebra to contain nondegenerate elements, but
// no native action functional, coefficient rule, or sector semantics selects one.
package hphinativescalaralgebra

